🟠 Volume claim pgdata in inventory (prod-eu-1) is failing: storage is over 95% used. It is at 98% of 20 GiB, and it is used by postgres and reporter. postgres fails with "PANIC:  could not write to file "pg_wal/xlogtemp.31": No space left on device". postgres is affected as well. Fix in: persistentvolumeclaim/pgdata → spec.resources.requests.storage (20Gi).
Also grouped: 1 crash loop
To check the size and capacity of the full volume claim, run kubectl describe pvc pgdata -n inventory
